// Max's Rage - granted fresh by BerserkSkillData.Begin every Overdrive activation, STARTING AT
// MaxStacks, and removed at End. Overdrive is powerful from the moment it's cast; the skill
// expression is keeping it there. Taking damage knocks Rage down (MaxOverdriveReactionSystem's
// OnHealthDamageApplied/OnShieldDamageApplied reaction -> RageOverdriveUtility.ResetStacks), landed
// weapon hits build it back (DamageUtility.ApplyDamage -> RageOverdriveUtility.TryAdvanceStack).
// A pure counter/condition with NO baked-in stat effect of its own - whether Max is "at max Rage"
// is a live boolean (RageOverdriveUtility.IsAtMaxRage) that Ascensions (Full Throttle, Ignition,
// Last Stand) react to on their own terms.
//
// This component's PRESENCE is also what every other Overdrive Ascension reads as "an activation is
// running right now" (MaxOverdriveReactionSystem, VendettaStrikeSkillAction), which is why it is
// removed at End.
component RageOverdrive
{
    Byte Stacks;
    Byte MaxStacks;

    // Fraction of CURRENT Rage a hit taken removes - seeded from BerserkSkillData.RageLossFraction at
    // Begin; Last Stand can only lower it (see RageOverdriveUtility.ResetStacks).
    FP LossFraction;
}
